00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:55.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses premiers patients.

00:01:52.346 --> 00:01:56.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dr GEORGES MAKDESSI, Centre de

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.117 size:53% position:73% line:53%
radio-oncologie régional, R.-N.t

00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:58.152 size:53% position:73% line:53%
